@joeroganhq @CharlotteCGill has been covering this. 

I look at UK government contracts; this advert is on a London bus stop, and Transport for London awarded a contract for £17.6 million for ‘Behaviour Change Marketing’ to VCCP; who has offices in China and Czechia, among other places. 

In the contract itself, the details of the various projects are redacted.
